  "descriptions": {
    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "Enables you to view and explore reflectance transformation imaging (rti) files at very high resolution (polynomial texture maps, hemispherical harmonics map, and multiview rti). You can view image files stored on your local file system, and remote files through http."
    }
